            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en">Using an average smartphone at active mode while consuming data via internet and transmission network, which includes wireless mobile network, IP core network, and global network.\n\n# Included processes\nThis data set includes the use of a smartphone and the energy consumption on the end user side. Additionally, the energy and embodied impacts associated with the transmission network on the could are also included. Low intensity means that the device consumption is higher than standard while data consumption is set at 7 GB per hour.</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
